Smokestack: credits and licences

Inspired by Steam. Our own rules text, map, names, art and layout; no component, art or text of
the original is used.

Code, rules and art: this repository (MIT, see LICENSE). The valley maps are generated by
games/smokestack/tools/gen-map.mjs; the terrain, track tiles, towns, cities, trains, goods, job cards and option
plaques are drawn by code in games/smokestack/src. The launcher art is made from the game's own frames by
games/smokestack/tools/make-art.sh. No third-party art or audio is shipped.

Font in the game: Fira Sans, the engine's built-in sans (cartwheel-engine), SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Font in the launcher art only (the logo): Bungee by David Jonathan Ross, SIL Open Font License 1.1
(games/smokestack/tools/fonts/Bungee-OFL.txt).
